# Customer Portal Environment Configuration

# Optional: Set full server or API URL if backend is on a separate host/subdomain.
# Leave empty or set to /api if using a reverse proxy (e.g., Nginx, Cloudflare) on your live apex domain.
# VITE_SERVER_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api
